{"lang":"ko","dir":"ltr","title":"Chateau Barber Shop | 나파 다운타운의 예약 없이 가는 바버숍","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">본문으로 건너뛰기</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C</span><span>Chateau Barber Shop</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">소개</a><a href=\"#services\">서비스</a><a href=\"#team\">바버</a><a href=\"#faq\">자주 묻는 질문</a><a href=\"#gallery\">사진</a><a href=\"#reviews\">리뷰</a><a href=\"#visit\">영업시간 및 위치</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"언어\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\" selected>한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17072557662\">전화</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/storefront.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">바버숍 · 나파 다운타운 · 2005년부터</p>\n    <h1>Chateau Barber Shop</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">나파 다운타운의 예약 없이 가는 바버숍. 정밀 커트, 수염 정리, 일자 면도칼 시술을 선착순으로 해 드립니다.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.9 · Google 리뷰 122개<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17072557662\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 가게로 전화하기</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%2C%201521%203rd%20St%2C%20Napa%2C%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> 길찾기</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li>Third St에서 20년</li><li>예약 없이 선착순</li><li>현금만 가능</li><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">리뷰 122개, 평점 4.9★</a></li><li>나파 다운타운</li><li>휠체어 접근 가능</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">우리 이야기</p><h2>커트와 정으로 이어 온 20년.</h2><p>사장 Santysouk &quot;San&quot; Yankee는 라오스 출신으로, 그곳에서 남성 커트와 스타일링을 배우고 자신의 미용실을 운영했습니다. 2001년 미국에 와서 새크라멘토의 이발 학교를 다녔고, 고인이 된 남편의 응원 속에 2005년 6월, 예전 Phil&#39;s Barber Shop 자리였던 1521 Third St.에 Chateau Barber Shop을 열었습니다.</p><p>20년이 지난 지금 이곳은 나파의 대표적인 바버숍 중 하나로, 문밖까지 줄이 이어지고 소노마, 발레호는 물론 샌프란시스코에서도 단골들이 찾아옵니다. 정밀 커트, 수염 정리, 일자 면도칼 면도와 라인 작업이 전문입니다. 예약은 필요 없어요. 들어와서 자리에 앉으시면 가족이 됩니다.</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.9★</b><span>리뷰 122개</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>20년</b><span>Third St에서</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>2005</b><span>San이 가게를 열다</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/shop-floor.jpg\" alt=\"Chateau Barber Shop 내부\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">전문 분야</p><h2>서비스 소개</h2></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>기본 커트</h3><span class=\"price\">$35</span></div><p>정밀 커트, 클래식 신사 커트, 최신 트렌드 스타일.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>어린이(10세 이하) 및 어르신(65세 이상)</h3><span class=\"price\">$25</span></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>수염</h3></div><p>수염 트리밍과 모양 정리.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>일자 면도칼 면도</h3></div><p>클래식 일자 면도칼과 핫타월 면도.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>라인 작업</h3></div><p>일자 면도칼로 깔끔하게 정리하는 라인과 경계.</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">가격표는 온라인에 올리지 않습니다. 현금만 받습니다. 문의는 (707) 255-7662로 전화 주세요.</p></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"team\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">팀 소개</p><h2>의자 뒤의 사람</h2><p>San을 찾으시거나 다음 빈자리에 앉으세요.</p></div><div class=\"team\"><article class=\"member\"><div class=\"member-head\"><div class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">S</div><div><h3>San</h3><p>Santysouk Yankee · 2005년부터 사장</p></div></div><p class=\"member-bio\">라오스 출신인 San은 2001년 이민 오기 전 그곳에서 실력을 갈고닦았습니다. 손님의 90%가 매주 또는 매달 다시 찾아옵니다.</p></article></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">알아두세요</p><h2>편의시설 및 이용 안내</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>예약 없이 방문</b><span>선착순. 예약 불가</span></li><li><b>현금만 가능</b></li><li><b>휠체어 접근 가능</b></li><li><b>길가 주차 및 주차장</b><span>Church St/4th St와 School St 사이</span></li><li><b>아이들도 환영</b><span>아이들은 막대사탕을 하나 고를 수 있어요</span></li><li><b>바로 옆에 식당</b><span>Winston’s가 바로 옆에 있어요</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">갤러리</p><h2>Chateau에서는</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/storefront.jpg\" alt=\"Chateau Barber Shop 매장 앞과 이발소 표시등\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/side-part.jpg\" alt=\"클래식 옆가르마\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/shop-floor.jpg\" alt=\"이발 의자와 액자 사진\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fresh-cut.jpg\" alt=\"갓 자른 머리, 앞모습과 옆모습\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/logo-sign.jpg\" alt=\"Chateau Barber Shop 간판\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/before-after.jpg\" alt=\"커트 전후\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/chairs.jpg\" alt=\"매장 내부\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/classic-cut.jpg\" alt=\"클래식 짧은 커트\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">언론 보도</p><h2>San이 직접 전하는 이야기</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“My business has grown tremendously from initially being an unknown barbershop with just myself cutting hair to being one of the main barbershops in Napa. Through excellent customer reviews and word of mouth, I have been able to grow my business into what it is today.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Napa Valley Register</b> · San Yankee, “Cuts and camaraderie,” Apr 22, 2025 · <a href=\"https://napavalleyregister.com/business/san-yankee-chateau-barber-shop-napa/article_6afa35bb-180f-421f-8b1f-81a082fc4950.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“Having Winston’s next door has helped many people find my barber shop. Also, sometimes while waiting in line for a haircut customers will stop by Winston’s for something delicious to eat. We love being neighbors with them”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Napa Valley Register</b> · San Yankee, Apr 22, 2025 · <a href=\"https://napavalleyregister.com/business/san-yankee-chateau-barber-shop-napa/article_6afa35bb-180f-421f-8b1f-81a082fc4950.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“We have people coming from Sonoma, Vallejo and sometimes even San Francisco”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Napa Valley Register</b> · San Yankee, “Chateau Barber Shop celebrates decade of service,” Dec 15, 2015 · <a href=\"https://napavalleyregister.com/business/chateau-barber-shop-celebrates-decade-of-service/article_26fc57db-4550-588f-8a20-742de348c257.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">리뷰</p><h2>고객 후기</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 리뷰 122개</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google에서 리뷰 더 보기 →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">5.0</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 리뷰 145개</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp에서 리뷰 더 보기 →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“People typically wait for the owner, but Andrea would always give a perfect cut, spending the time to pay close attention to detail. I like that a bald fade was truly a bald fade when coming here, some places arent willing to fully shave down to the skin when asked. This place was my go-to while living in the area and was always worth the drive for me. Miss coming here and will definitely go back when Im local.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“San, is great with kids when I first started taking my son there he was two and a half He&#39;s 15 now Love this place super quick super professional and does a great job !!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Adam W. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Mar 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“It is absolutely fabulous the owner&#39;s been cutting my hair for the past 15 years”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“San has been doing my hair since I was young and I&#39;ve had 4 people ever doing my hair and she has done the best she is my favorite barber ever!and I totally recommend this barber shop.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Nikolas R. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · May 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“San is an amazing barber always friendly and can get you feeling brand new. If you are having a bad day go get a haircut but keep the negativity at home. If busy you should wait it&#39;s worth it.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jul 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“There&#39;s a long line, it&#39;s cash only and they have $30 haircuts; kids 10 and under, and seniors 65 and older $25. San is skilled and did an excellent job quickly.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Wayne G. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Jul 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“San is amazing! I’ve been coming here for 10+ years. It’s First Come First Serve but she is efficient! After the first time I came she remembered my style. She’s the best. People wait for her for a reason.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“San is the best in the business always delivers a fresh cut. Good prices Wait time not bad. Street parking and a parking lot. Downtown Napa.”</blockquote><figcaption>— John T. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Feb 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“We found our new spot to take my 5 year old for an amazing, quick, friendly, and stylish cut! San was amazing with my son and he loved getting to pick his own lollipop.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Chateau%20Barber%20Shop%201521%203rd%20St%20Napa%20CA%2094559\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jul 2020</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">자주 묻는 질문</p><h2>궁금한 점을 알려드려요</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>예약을 받나요?</summary><p>아니요, 예약 없이 방문 순서대로만 받습니다. 가끔 문밖까지 줄이 서지만 기다릴 만한 가치가 있다고 생각해요.</p></details><details><summary>현금만 받나요?</summary><p>네, 현금만 받습니다.</p></details><details><summary>커트 가격은 얼마인가요?</summary><p>기본 커트는 약 $35이고, 10세 이하 어린이와 65세 이상 어르신은 할인 가격(약 $25)입니다. 가격은 바뀔 수 있으니 (707) 255-7662로 전화 주세요.</p></details><details><summary>영업시간은 어떻게 되나요?</summary><p>화요일–금요일 오전 9시–오후 6시, 토요일 오전 9시–오후 4시 영업합니다. 일요일과 월요일은 쉽니다.</p></details><details><summary>주차는 어디에 하나요?</summary><p>길가 주차와 근처 주차장이 있습니다. 나파 다운타운 1521 3rd St에 있어요.</p></details><details><summary>가게는 언제부터 운영했나요?</summary><p>제가 2005년 6월에 Chateau Barber Shop을 열었고, 2025년 6월 1일에 20주년을 맞았습니다.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">방문 안내</p>\n      <h2>영업시간 및 위치</h2>\n      <address>1521 3rd St<br>Napa, CA 94559</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17072557662\">(707) 255-7662</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>월요일</td><td>휴무</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>화요일</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>수요일</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>목요일</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>금요일</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>토요일</td><td>9 AM – 4 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>일요일</td><td>휴무</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">방문 순서대로만 받으며 예약은 받지 않습니다. 현금만 받습니다.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/the_chateau_barbershop/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg><span>@the_chateau_barbershop</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/293242531597152\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 8h3V4h-3a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2H8v4h2v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V8z\"/></svg><span>Facebook</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/chateau-barber-shop-napa#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Yelp</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Chateau+Barber+Shop/@38.2954502,-122.2888629,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80850642956de0c9:0xb7f904ac311b28e8!8m2!3d38.2954502!4d-122.2888629!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidd